  "_description": "Names the capability and LiveObjects detectors can't read from the spec: SDK client aliases, door factories (2.0 split SDKs), earlier-revision and spec-prose LiveObjects names, and the fallback used only when the spec can't be parsed. Update this file, not the scripts, when an SDK adds an alias or a door, or the spec renames something. Everything else (client, channel, connection, presence and LiveObjects names and members) is read at run time from the spec clone by scripts/spec_names.py (section 13.8). Keys starting with '_' are ignored.",
