  "doorFactories": {
    "_comment": "Public entry points of split SDKs (2.0 'doors'). A door factory's capability comes from its return type, else its name (Http or Rest: REST; otherwise realtime). Its side comes from its enclosing type (sides.*.types, matched whole, e.g. static class PubSubDevice) or else a path segment (sides.*.paths, e.g. Ably.PubSub.Device, pubsub-device); a door with neither is core. Sides come only from doors: a client type under a 'device' path (push LocalDevice code) is not a side.",
